@Ariva.Api.Integration_HostAddress = http://localhost:51005

### Startup probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Integration_HostAddress}}/health/startup
Accept: application/json

### Readiness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Integration_HostAddress}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Liveness probe
GET {{Ariva.Api.Integration_HostAddress}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json
